  "scope": "Current implementation with passing Core/protocol/projection/Store/Rust and SDK regressions plus actual WT descriptor continuity. Complete browser cohort has14passes/1failure: original WSS handoff reachedunknown before new descriptor checks. WSS descriptor behavior and fulltask are not qualified.",
  "implementation": [
    "The sealed atomic Core AudioAudienceCommit retains immutable actual touched logical gate facts. Empty facts mean no gate changed; later live confirmation still requires current credentials, unchanged ports and exact revision. Historical metadata grants no media IO.",
    "A separately bounded typed metadata sidecar binds every actual receiver and unique bounded logical Stream incarnation. It does not inflate the public32KiB outcome or expose codec/port handles.",
    "Original handoff, consultation and return attribution carries descriptors only after an exact guarded readiness update for the same ready/active incarnation and contiguous control revision. Missing, unavailable, retired, replaced or newer snapshots are never relabeled as fresh. Missing or wrong gate descriptors make metadata unavailable without inventing resources.",
    "Route-only carry preserves Stream IDs and resource revisions. Actual touched gates update only matching audio Stream states/resource counters. Effect attribution and projection occur in the same original transaction.",
    "Rust ConnectionSnapshot now consumes the declared independent optional bounded stream_revision observation. Browser and shared native facade observation paths retain their existing behavior.",
    "Application HTTP/OpenAPI/dispatch and endpoint source inventories refreshed; Store schema remains115."
  ],
